  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The Vanguard are the military arm and command the fleets and fortress worlds of the Skath. It is without doubt the biggest faction of their kind, due in part to their desire to protect their spawn-worlds. The Vanguard believes that with enough warships and enough defensive measurements, other races will not dare to attack, thus resulting in peace. Unfortunately, this is but a concept...and not how things actually work in practice.",
    "value": "先驱是掌控海鳞族舰队与要塞世界的军事力量，无疑为其种族中规模最大的派系，部分源于其对繁衍世界的保护欲。先驱认为，只要拥有足够战舰与防御手段，他族便不敢进犯，从而实现和平。可惜这仅是理想...而非现实。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The Vanguards duty is to protect Skath worlds by any means necessary. Commanders and Admirals of their fleets have follow the Codex of War to the letter. Of course, these rules are subject to change at a moments notice due to the interference of the Council, and even the most intelligent Admiral is at their mercy when it comes to rule of law.",
    "value": "先驱的职责是以一切必要手段守护海鳞族世界，其舰队指挥官与将领严格遵循《战争法典》。然而，因议会干预，这些条例随时可能变更，即便最睿智的将领亦难逃法律束缚。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "More than one invasion has been carried out under the pretense of 'protecting' their kind, and many more will follow so long as inept leadership is allowed to rule their people. The very nature of their council is corrupt at its root, and the average Skath is ignorant of the extent of this issue. The result is a social heirarchy reliant on unjust and idiotic leaders quite accepting of bribes and general favoritism based on profits.",
    "value": "多次侵略战争皆以“自卫”之名发动。只要无能的领导继续执政，战事便不会止息。多数海鳞族未能察觉腐败议会的危害，整个社会阶层正被愚蠢不公、受贿徇私的官僚所控。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/3",
    "raw": "Some have even whispered that the Kirhosi may be partly responsible for this corruption through the promotion of trade markets in Skathian territories, but this is hearsay I cannot verify. By casual observation, I would tend to agree...to a point. Kirhosi are hardly secretive about their love of Trade for profit.",
    "value": "有人私下指出，鼠族人或为腐败推手之一，因其在海鳞族领地大力推广贸易市场。然此说仅为未经证实的流言。据我偶然观察，我倾向于认同...至少部分认同。鼠族人对贸易牟利的热衷，可谓毫不掩饰。"
  }
]